soroban-poseidon (vendored)

Upstream repository: https://github.com/stellar/rs-soroban-poseidon
Release vendored:    28.0.0 (crates.io), upstream commit 521da986541843a5cd1a94f36f681f14bdad3b90
Licence:             Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

This directory is the published soroban-poseidon 28.0.0 crate (Cargo.toml,
LICENSE, README.md and src/) as downloaded from crates.io, with one change:

    the soroban-sdk requirement (dependencies and dev-dependencies) is
    "29.0.1" instead of "28.0.0".

No upstream release of soroban-poseidon accepts soroban-sdk 29. The workspace
uses this copy through a path dependency in the root Cargo.toml. The directory
is excluded from the workspace (so workspace clippy, tests and coverage do not
cover it) and ignored by the root rustfmt.toml (so the source stays identical
to the published crate). Remove this directory, its `exclude` entry and the
rustfmt `ignore`, and point `soroban-poseidon` back at crates.io, once
upstream publishes a release that accepts soroban-sdk 29.
